==English==
{{was wotd|2007|April|17}}

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|en|plousiocracy|ploutocracy}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|en|grc|πλουτοκρατία|t=rule of the wealthy}}, from {{m|grc|πλουτοκρατέω|t=I rule through wealth}}, from {{m|grc|πλοῦτος|t=wealth}} + {{m|grc|κρατέω|t=I rule}} (from {{m|grc|κράτος|t=power”, “might}}).

